Z||000007||EdsB52||04-26-2001||01:43 AM||||Appreciate it Vlad. I wonder if there's a way I can learn who the lean holder is, if a current lean holder exists. The car was donated to an organization and they were trying to sell it for $2500, which is way too high. Anyway, the car has sat in the parking lot for about a year collecting dust as the president of the group refuses my offers. I'm thinking there is an open lein on the car and the organization is trying to get the lein amount plus whatever. The tags ran out in October, 2000, so the info you gave makes perfect chronological sense. The liars tried telling me the car is a one owner. It could be, but it sounds as if the car has had a couple of leins against it, so that would generally refute the one owner claim. Thanks again my friend, and if you need any 4 cyl odds and ends, email me, I might have some freebies I can throw your way. Ed.||||reg||1
